    <briefdescription>
<para>This class contains a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1raw__fd__ostream" kindref="compound">raw_fd_ostream</ref> and adds a few extra features commonly needed for compiler-like tool output files: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The file is automatically deleted if the process is killed.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The file is automatically deleted when the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_tool_output_file" kindref="compound">ToolOutputFile</ref> object is destroyed unless the client calls <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_tool_output_file_1a736bcda698a82e4ae3a92310d706868d" kindref="member">keep()</ref>. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
